  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="price_clause">
        <p>Salimbene de Salimbenis dat Ubertino de Malavoltis pratum situm iuxta flumen Arbia in loco qui dicitur Molino Vecchio, et accipit in commutatione pratum in contrata Sanctae Mariae cum iure aquae et pascui, utraque parte consentiente et laudante.</p>
      </div>
      <div type="penalty_clause">
        <p>Si quis ex partibus hanc commutationem rescindere temptaverit, poenam dupli valoris rerum commutatarum persolvat et carta ista in suo robore permaneat.</p>
      </div>
      <listWitness>
        <witness>
          <name>Guido de Tolomeis</name>
        </witness>
        <witness>
          <name>Farinatus filius Ugolini</name>
        </witness>
        <witness>
          <name>Orlandus de Scottis</name>
        </witness>
      </listWitness>
    </body>
